AGRM_YN^동의여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
PROS_ABLE_YN^처리가능여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
			<TRAN name="obtss_opnf_048a" title="오픈뱅킹_이용재동의여부관리" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="162" _ulen="126" >

PROS_CLS_CODE^처리구분코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
ELFN_ID^전자금융ID^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
AGRM_YN^동의여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
		</TRIO_INFO>
	</DATAIO_INFO>
</ROOT>